#text("Run 20261019-165506-boolean-recursive-native-188e81, source 0acfc55b7f. Dedicated c7i.2xlarge, one worker and a reserved complete physical core; four-worker controls reserve two cores/SMT siblings. Exact source/compiler/CPU/ISA and binary manifests remain in the raw tree. Baseline: frozen a78 algorithm with all three previously qualified GF2 switches. Candidate: identity-bound prepared construction and bounded quadratic-tail policies.")


#text("Original n17/n23 fixtures have16/22 Boolean variables on icv1-f2m17-tm101-00378d4e / icv1-f2m23-tm5197-1f85e9e1. Planted seed230 and fixed generator control plus planted holdouts231/232; random=true means generator here. n19's36-variable admission gap remains separate. No fixture or baseline is replaced by the full-DLP standard subspaces.")


#text("All eighteen arms are rerun with this source's declared policies. Complete original roots and first-witness decomposition remain separate; common curve/base construction is outside component timings. Fresh target ANF, solving, lifting and internal verification are charged to decomposition; Semaev fresh table setup is charged once. Independent original-root/group audits run after elapsed capture.")


#text("Five paired rounds, first eligible of at most three attempts, exact original outputs, exact3125-resample CI and max(2%, twice A/A noise) gate. Rejected attempts retained: 42. All four multiworker controls neutral: True. Every slower/neutral/missing cell remains in native-summary.json.")


#text("Prepared is a combined active-layout/top-degree/linear-tail/direct-packing ablation. Quadratic-tail retains an algebraic root reduction, then exhaustively completes at most16 free quadratic variables using the existing Gray kernel; original coordinates, root order, caps and verification remain enforced. This is a hybrid engineering change, not a novel enumeration algorithm. Other split rules/custom node oracles keep recursion.")


#text("The matrix switches stay opt-in. Source/protocols: 0acfc55b7f, PROTOCOL.md and the frozen runner/protocols in the raw tree. Sources0acfc55b7f,71c4c99d85 and9bed104b0a are separate experiments. The final adaptive variants preserve cheap degree-two refutations below16 original variables; legacy policy names remain for replay. Full-table setup uses the same exact sorted tuples serially under an explicit one-worker resource contract. No cross-host pooling, external-fastest, Arm64/GPU, whole-IC/rho or hard-family8x conclusion follows from component calls.")


